## Delete custom rule (forced)

Forces deletion of a custom rule, even if it is actively used by detectors.

### Example request

```json
DELETE /_plugins/_security_analytics/rules/ZaFv1IMBdLpXWBiBa1XI?forced=true
```

### Example response

```json
{
    "_id": "ZaFv1IMBdLpXWBiBa1XI",
    "_version": 1
}
```

