Note the model ID in the response; you'll use it in the following steps.

To test the model, call the Predict API:

```json
POST _plugins/_ml/models/your_model_id/_predict
{
  "parameters": {
    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "I like you",
        "text_pair": "I hate you"
