## Step 3: Create an index and ingest data 

To create a vector index, send the following request:

```json
PUT opensearch_docs
{
  "settings": {
    "index.knn": true,
    "default_pipeline": "bedrock-text-embedding-pipeline"
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "passage_chunk": {
        "type": "nested",
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "text"
          },
          "embedding": {
            "type": "knn_vector",
            "dimension": 1024
          }
        }
      },
      "passage_text": {
        "type": "text"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
