```

## Step 2: Ingest data

First, create an ingest pipeline:

```json
PUT /_ingest/pipeline/pipeline-cohere
{
  "description": "Cohere embedding ingest pipeline",
  "processors": [
    {
      "text_embedding": {
        "model_id": "your_embedding_model_id_created_in_step1",
