  "settings": {
    "index": {
      "knn": true,
      "knn.algo_param.ef_search": 100,
      "default_pipeline": "pipeline-cohere"
    }
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "passage_text": {
        "type": "text"
      },
      "passage_embedding": {
        "type": "knn_vector",
        "dimension": 1024,
        "data_type": "byte",
        "method": {
          "name": "hnsw",
          "space_type": "l2",
          "engine": "lucene",
          "parameters": {
            "ef_construction": 128,
            "m": 24
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
{% include copy-curl.html %}

Last, ingest test data:

```json
POST _bulk
