  "version": "1.0.1",
  "model_format": "TORCH_SCRIPT"
}
```
{% include copy-curl.html %}

After deployment, use the `model_id` of the tokenizer in your query:

```json
GET my-nlp-index/_search
{
  "query": {
    "neural_sparse": {
      "passage_embedding": {
        "query_text": "Hi world",
        "model_id": "<tokenizer model_id>"
      }
    }
